      "text": "❓ TRIED:  pre-order groceries to a fixed weekly menu.\nThe menu is decided same-day and shifts last minute, so the order is wrong the moment someone changes their mind.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "nGbUxFtvZW",
      "originalText": "❓ TRIED:  pre-order groceries to a fixed weekly menu.\nThe menu is decided same-day and shifts last minute, so the order is wrong the moment someone changes their mind.",
