      "updated": 1789054510558,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "❓ OLD\nThe schedule is fixed for the week. An ingredient runs short mid-week, the household places an instant order, and nobody learns why the plan missed it. The shortage never reaches the model.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mOpB6RaABg",
      "originalText": "❓ OLD\nThe schedule is fixed for the week. An ingredient runs short mid-week, the household places an instant order, and nobody learns why the plan missed it. The shortage never reaches the model.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
    },
